{"id":2380,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为丰富学生社区文化生活，以轻量趣味的手工形式为同学们搭建创意实践平台，5月17日下午，中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院创意拼豆体验活动顺利开展，同学们在彩豆拼接中解锁创作乐趣，共度治愈午后时光。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMRv24Ml74UmvDMd4LiL4VVnlM2MzA-2olMRnm6fMzvDnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkUYyiU1hko7L8M8rRLmLbL49DMlrfMzfVoRfRLRV7LzVFM4MRnm7DUNrFL47YL7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LiMzvsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=35577&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CBC5BB8C47EC2393865EA50E80C01D11/73CF16BE/3120F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMRv24Ml74UmvDMd4LiL4VVnlM2MzA-2olMRnm6fMzvDnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkUYyiU1hko7L8M8rRLmLbL49DMlrfMzfVoRfRLRV7LzVFM4MRnm7DUNrFL47YL7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LiMzvsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=35577&e=.png\"></p><p>活动现场气氛轻松热烈，同学们化身创意“豆”手，在指尖翻飞间搭配色彩、排布图案，软萌卡通形象与特色校园元素纷纷成型。大家互相分享创作心得，在沉浸式制作中迸发新奇想法，欢声笑语萦绕现场。</p><p>本次活动依托书院育人平台开展趣味实践活动，既丰富了同学们的课余生活，也让大家在亲手创作中陶冶情操，舒缓日常学习节奏，切实拉近了同学之间的距离，助力打造和睦融洽、朝气蓬勃的社区环境。</p><p>一审一校：吉思颖</p><p>二审二校：王熠暄</p><p>三审三校：王慧慧</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VMRv24Ml74UmvDMd4LiL4VVnlM2MzA-2olMRnm6fMzvDnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkUYyiU1hko7L8M8rRLmLbL49DMlrfMzfVoRfRLRV7LzVFM4MRnm7DUNrFL47YL7CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LiMzvsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=35577&e=.png"}